      Title: Test Stew
Categories: Soups, Main dish
   Servings:  8
 
      2 x  Small beets                         1 c  Navy beans, dry
           -- thinly sliced                    1 tb Black truffles, finely chopp
      1 ea Bay leaf                                 -d
      1 cn (1 lb 13 oz) tomatoes
-----SAUCE-----
      1 ga Water
      1 pg (10 oz) raspberries
      1 lb Puff pastry                              Watercress for garnish
 
  Simmer the stew for an hour.
  Serve hot.
 
